# {{PROJECT}} UI/UX standards

Normative for everything a user sees. Seeded by `/workflow:plan-project` on {{DATE}} (UI kit: `{{UI_ID}}`).
Enforcement tags as in `docs/ENGINEERING-STANDARDS.md`: `[hook]`, `[ci: gate]`, `[guard-test]`,
`[review]`, `[ux]` (the ux-critic and the verifier check it on screenshots), `[not yet: X]`.

**Ranking:** security and data loss > ease of use for the person doing the job > code quality > speed.
A surface is finished when a real user can complete the job and recover from a mistake on it, not when
it renders.

